Third-party components
----------------------
The firmware is built on these projects. They are NOT included in this repository: the build fetches them
at the pinned versions below.

  WLED                     v16.0.1 (tag v16.0.1, commit 29b389df1c1aaec6ff53aea742d17063b985906c)
                           https://github.com/wled/WLED                       EUPL-1.2 (or later)
  wled-usermod-powermanager commit c7d92255a8c5106ac9abb9ab504967a287f36510
                           https://github.com/intermittech/wled-usermod-powermanager   EUPL-1.2
                           (also the source of the Dig-Next-2 build environment this repository's
                           platformio_override.ini is derived from)

A compiled firmware image also contains the libraries, framework and toolchain runtime that WLED v16.0.1
pins in its platformio.ini (Arduino-ESP32 / ESP-IDF, FastLED, NeoPixelBus, ArduinoJson, AsyncTCP,
ESPAsyncWebServer and others), each under its own licence; see WLED's repository at that tag.

Firmware binaries
-----------------
This repository does not ship firmware binaries. Anyone distributing a binary built from it must include
firmware/LICENSE, this NOTICE, and a link to the corresponding source (this repository at the matching
commit, plus the WLED and PowerManager versions above), as the EUPL requires.
